   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">李老師與各位高手好，</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">小弟這幾天才開始學習</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">R</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">語言</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">之前只有寫過</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">C</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">與</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">JAVA)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">由於禮拜六日剛上完李老師與鄒老師的課，因此想練習程式要抓取</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">WEB:</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"http://www.expodatabase.com/aussteller/messen/index.php?OK=1&amp;sortierid=0&amp;maxPerPage=20&amp;i_cockpitkeyfindwo=2&amp;i_cockpitkeyfindart=1&amp;currPage=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.expodatabase.com/aussteller/messen/index.php?OK%3D1%26sortierid%3D0%26maxPerPage%3D20%26i_cockpitkeyfindwo%3D2%26i_cockpitkeyfindart%3D1%26currPage%3D1&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237731344000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Oul2ilAq7jJ2c26EtKECy\">http://www.expodatabase.com/aussteller/messen/index.php?OK=1&amp;sortierid=0&amp;maxPerPage=20&amp;i_cockpitkeyfindwo=2&amp;i_cockpitkeyfindart=1&amp;currPage=1</a></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">的網頁資料</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">以下為不才寫的程式碼</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">:</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">####################  程式碼開始 ##############################<br></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">library(XML)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">library(RCurl)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"># only for windows -----</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">signatures &lt;-\r\nsystem.file(&quot;CurlSSL&quot;, cainfo=&quot;cacert.pem&quot;,\r\npackage=&quot;RCurl&quot;)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">#get url -----</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">url\r\n&lt;-&quot;<a href=\"http://www.expodatabase.com/aussteller/messen/index.php?OK=1&amp;sortierid=0&amp;maxPerPage=20&amp;i_cockpitkeyfindwo=2&amp;i_cockpitkeyfindart=1&amp;currPage=\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.expodatabase.com/aussteller/messen/index.php?OK%3D1%26sortierid%3D0%26maxPerPage%3D20%26i_cockpitkeyfindwo%3D2%26i_cockpitkeyfindart%3D1%26currPage%3D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237731344000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0nhxTe3A0Uw0WBcVY1iG9m\">http://www.expodatabase.com/aussteller/messen/index.php?OK=1&amp;sortierid=0&amp;maxPerPage=20&amp;i_cockpitkeyfindwo=2&amp;i_cockpitkeyfindart=1&amp;currPage=</a>&quot;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">url &lt;- paste0(url, 1)  # first page...</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">url&lt;- getURL(paste0(url), cainfo =\r\nsignatures)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">url&lt;- htmlParse(url)</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">date &lt;- xpathSApply(url,\r\n&quot;//div[@class=&#39;listdates&#39;]/div&quot;,xmlValue)<br></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">date \r\n#show date</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">city&lt;- unlist(xpathSApply(url,\r\n&quot;//div[@class=&#39;city&#39;]&quot;,xmlValue))<br></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">city \r\n# city name</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">branchen&lt;- unlist(xpathSApply(url,\r\n&quot;//div[@class=&#39;search_result_box_right&#39;]/div&quot;,xmlValue))<br></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">branchen #Business sectors</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">sublink &lt;- unlist(xpathSApply(url,\r\n&quot;//div[@class=&#39;firma&#39;]/a&quot;, xmlGetAttr, &quot;href&quot;))<br></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">sublink </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">snap &lt;- unlist(xpathSApply(url,\r\n&quot;//div[@class=&#39;firma&#39;]/a[@href]&quot;,xmlValue))<br></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">snap # web snap...</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">####################  程式碼結束 ##############################</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">程式碼主要是要擷取剪圖中，用紅框標示的區域</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"font-family:新細明體,serif\">，請見下圖一</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-x4yfbZ2NGzs/Vm9tm0YdyuI/AAAAAAAAKOI/UovFh2ZgLCY/s1600/%25E5%259C%2596%25E4%25B8%2580.jpg\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-x4yfbZ2NGzs/Vm9tm0YdyuI/AAAAAAAAKOI/UovFh2ZgLCY/s1600/%2525E5%25259C%252596%2525E4%2525B8%252580.jpg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237731344000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3X2YjgRzHgFnqhkH5Yf4MV\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-x4yfbZ2NGzs/Vm9tm0YdyuI/AAAAAAAAKOI/UovFh2ZgLCY/s320/%25E5%259C%2596%25E4%25B8%2580.jpg\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"131\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\">圖一</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">程式也的確是可以運作成功</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">，見下圖二</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family:&quot;MS Mincho&quot;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-GIzA_JHOKD4/Vm9t2MIa0YI/AAAAAAAAKOQ/NOhjopgGFIE/s1600/%25E5%259C%25962.jpg\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-GIzA_JHOKD4/Vm9t2MIa0YI/AAAAAAAAKOQ/NOhjopgGFIE/s1600/%2525E5%25259C%2525962.jpg&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237731344000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1FoLk1wp-Bq64qLzm2GPBK\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-GIzA_JHOKD4/Vm9t2MIa0YI/AAAAAAAAKOQ/NOhjopgGFIE/s320/%25E5%259C%25962.jpg\" border=\"0\" width=\"320\" height=\"97\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\">圖二</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">不過小弟的問題來了，</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">由於網頁</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">:</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><a href=\"http://www.expodatabase.com/aussteller/messen/index.php?OK=1&amp;sortierid=0&amp;maxPerPage=20&amp;i_cockpitkeyfindwo=2&amp;i_cockpitkeyfindart=1&amp;currPage=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.expodatabase.com/aussteller/messen/index.php?OK%3D1%26sortierid%3D0%26maxPerPage%3D20%26i_cockpitkeyfindwo%3D2%26i_cockpitkeyfindart%3D1%26currPage%3D1&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237731344000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Oul2ilAq7jJ2c26EtKECy\">http://www.expodatabase.com/aussteller/messen/index.php?OK=1&amp;sortierid=0&amp;maxPerPage=20&amp;i_cockpitkeyfindwo=2&amp;i_cockpitkeyfindart=1&amp;currPage=1</a></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">預設一次是秀出</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">20</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">筆資料，程式的撰寫方式是把各個屬性的資料，分別的存在不同的字元</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">list</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">之中。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:新細明體,serif\">如果每一個屬性都是單純的只有一筆資料，例如</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">branchen</span><span style=\"font-family:新細明體,serif\">有</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">20</span><span style=\"font-family:新細明體,serif\">筆、</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">city</span><span style=\"font-family:新細明體,serif\">也有</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">20</span><span style=\"font-family:新細明體,serif\">筆那事情就比較好解決，我只要一個蘿蔔對映一個坑去按照索引比對資料，但問題在於</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">date</span><span style=\"font-family:新細明體,serif\">卻是有</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">35</span><span style=\"font-family:新細明體,serif\">筆，這表示有些屬性的資料可能會超過一筆以上或是沒有資料。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:新細明體,serif\">因此，我的問題在於不知那一個</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">branchen</span><span style=\"font-family:新細明體,serif\">會對映至那一個</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">city </span><span style=\"font-family:新細明體,serif\">、</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">date</span><span style=\"font-family:新細明體,serif\">與</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">snap</span><span style=\"font-family:新細明體,serif\">等等。</span><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:新細明體,serif\">在此想請問李老師與各位高手建議，程式要如何改進，把不同屬性的同資料透過</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">xpathSApply(匿名函數撰寫)</span><span style=\"font-family:新細明體,serif\">歸類成同一筆資料集合</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:新細明體,serif\">例如</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"> data.frame ?)</span><span style=\"font-family:新細明體,serif\">，想存成的資料會如同第一張圖所示。</span><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">謝謝各位</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">!</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">附註: R真是一個有趣的語言...有一點相見恨晚...</span></p></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
